Z||000000||85ZainoGT||08-25-2001||04:28 PM||||How do I go about learning Adobe Photoshop????  I want to change the color of my car put some rims on it and tint the windows... and much much more.. I want to see what it will look like...  any idea of how to learn?||||reg||5
Z||000001||Songman||08-25-2001||04:43 PM||||Remember the old adage that practice makes perfect. It holds true with Photoshop as well...<P>Learn to use layers, fills, filters, different color mods like hue and saturation,etc... Just open your picture and play around with it... nothing is permanent until you hit save... I recommend Save As to leave your original picture as is...<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
